[[0,259]],[["dc89894b_226701c6",25,0,1,"Small optimization idea (not needed for this CL). If the feature is disabled, I do wonder what's stopping us from just returning here and releasing the `model_broker_client_` and not initializing any…"]],0,870],[7234551,20433,531,10.952,8.912,[[0,0.973,260,472],[18,0.027,287,11]],[["25468735_00f4fe21",25,0,0,"Do we want to log the execution duration here similar to on-device call?"],["76d134f5_2e7fedfe",24,0,1,"nit: do you think it's worth it to test that `CancelIntelligentScan` on an already-cancelled scan ID(s) returns false?"],["c0560e1c_8740c2cf",24,0,1,"Just curious, what's the reasoning for calling the 2 parameter function instead of the single one for all these test under this class when passing along `MODEL_EXECUTION_FEATURE_SCAM_DETECTION`? Is…"]],0,871],[7251901,20438,238,4.195,3.394,[[0,0.919,261,224],[18,0.06,288,11],[1,0.02,207,3]],[["622bca28_595922b6",25,-1,1,"What do you think about logging every time we hit this quota? It's the same concept as CSD ping limit. I think with the way it's set up right now, we won't know how often we'd hit this.…"],["6d80fb38_f99fb484",23,-1,1,"As mentioned in the other test comment, might be similar to [this](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:chrome/browser/safe_browsing/client_side_detection_host_unittest.cc;l=3941?q…"],["71be6703_9b23193f",30,-1,1,"What do you think about refunding the quota (calling `OnIntelligentScanVerdict`) here so that `ShouldShowScamWarning` isn't checked twice, and only if the UI manager is available and will be…"],["a7b7e36c_4c1f7f7d",25,-1,0,"From the other comment, if we were to add to quota on a successful response, I think this would be a better place, with checking for `is_server_model_enabled_`."],["c7015fe0_6540b59c",25,-1,1,"Should we add a `D/CHECK(!update->empty())` just in case?"],["dff9fd00_3fd3b5ec",25,-1,0,"Should the quota be added if the execution fails or the user navigates away from the page during the execution? I wonder if it's better if we were to add to the quota if the ping has been…"],["f915dcdb_f873611d",23,-1,1,"I think this test might be the similar to [this test](https://source.chromium.org/chromium/chromium/src/+/main:chrome/browser/safe_browsing/client_side_detection_host_unittest.cc;l=3878;drc=ae15760cea…"],["5d137eb2_7836cc5f",37,0,0,"I believe this is the right number, but please resolve this comment based on the comment from the design doc."],["81562c06_b2b12824",38,0,1,"nit: no longer needed"],["a3b67bff_120745fb",38,0,1,"nit: no longer needed"],["be0c2e8f_f442db2f",24,0,1,"Could we expand on this test or make a new one to make sure that quota is still logged although the server model response has failed?"],["d1876cab_24f68714",38,0,1,"nit: no longer needed"]],0,872],[7267404,20439,9,0.381,0.349,[[18,289]],[],0,873],[7270309,20441,31,0.721,0.543,[[20,0.857,62,27],[2,0.143,207,4]],[],0,874],[7271104,20441,85,2.344,1.853,[[0,262]],[],0,875],[7298431,20445,26,0.698,0.559,[[2,208]],[],0,876],[7311754,20445,2,0.088,0.061,[[2,209]],[],0,877],[7266922,20445,31,1.08,0.91,[[18,290]],[],0,878],[7265737,20445,93,2.344,1.853,[[0,0.64,263,59],[1,0.36,208,34]],[["02d46aad_d04ed29b",24,-4,1,"How about checking here as well?"],["0bae025c_ab2811bb",30,-4,0,"The commit message states that the model type is included in ClientPhishingRequest, but we're not adding it here. Do you intend to do that in this CL or a separate CL?"],["23822d7c_1153925d",35,-4,0,"I don't think this is true for this CL. Do you intend on populating it in the ping in this CL as well?"],["9aace0e5_ddf433e8",23,-4,0,"I'm a little confused that this proto field can exist without the csd.proto update, but this is a correct test."],["b2b056e7_73391793",38,-4,1,"Should we have a 0 value here for unknown for older versions of pings that are being sent?"]],0,879]]}